## Before you begin

The official installation steps are being documented alongside the project. This page will become the single source of truth for requirements, supported systems, and verified commands.

For now, use the checklist below to prepare a clean starting point:

- Confirm the target machine and its Linux base system.
- Back up personal configuration before changing your desktop.
- Read each configuration step before applying it.
- Keep a note of changes so they can be reversed.

## What this guide will cover

1. System requirements and supported environments.
2. A verified installation path.
3. Optional themes and their compatibility.
4. Recovery and rollback notes.

> Commands will only be added here after they are verified in the Pegasus repository.
